Subject: [PATCH 1/4] build: 修改 applicationId 为 com.hrk.tgwear

包名必须与手表端快应用 manifest.json 中的 package 字段完全一致，
否则 interconnect 通信会被路由到错误的 App。

---
 TMessagesProj/build.gradle | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/build.gradle b/TMessagesProj/build.gradle
index 0000000..1111111 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/build.gradle
+++ b/TMessagesProj/build.gradle
@@
-        applicationId "org.telegram.messenger"
+        applicationId "com.hrk.tgwear"
@@
